    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"apna","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/apnahq"},"datePublished":"2026-03-24T11:16:37.910Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_hiring-recruitment-hiringpartners-activity-7442167488043417600-mQES","text":"Big teams need strong people to grow.\n\nWe’ve partnered with Bajaj General Insurance (Bajaj Life Insurance Company), and they are now hiring on Apna for Agency Development Managers, Sales Managers, Business Development Managers and Team Leaders across locations.\n\nAs they expand their reach, the focus is on finding the right people faster and building teams that can deliver consistently. We’re glad to support this journey by making hiring simpler and more efficient.\n\nBuild your team on Apna: https://lnkd.in/gHZZ-s_J\n\n#Hiring #Recruitment #HiringPartners #TalentAcquisition \n\nNirmit Parikh | Karna Chokshi | Kartik Narayan | Mayuresh Shinde (MS) | Abhijeet Anand | Vipin Kalra | Saksham Gandhi | Thomas Lagashu | Naveen Bokka | Himanshu Pandey | Sonu A.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_hiring-recruitment-hiringpartners-activity-7442167488043417600-mQES"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"apna","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/apnahq"},"datePublished":"2026-03-24T07:00:37.316Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_some-roles-look-simple-on-paper-but-they-activity-7442103061025640448-0u92","text":"Some roles look simple on paper.\nBut they’re much harder to assess in real interviews.\n\nLet’s be honest about which roles are toughest to evaluate.\n\nVote below 👇","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_some-roles-look-simple-on-paper-but-they-activity-7442103061025640448-0u92"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"apna","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/apnahq"},"datePublished":"2026-03-23T12:11:07.763Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_office-hustle-culture-activity-7441818814918602752-Waw3","text":"\"Cheezen jabtak perfect na ho, theek nhi lagti!\"\n\nAt apna, rooms aren’t named randomly.\nThey’re named after stories that reflect how we think and work.\n\nWhenever someone enters this room, they know the expectation.\nCome in with a goal. Leave with progress.\n\nThat is how we operate every day. A lot of hustle, a lot of ownership, and a strong belief that the right opportunity can change someone’s life. Especially in a country like India, where access can make all the difference, that responsibility means everything to us.\n\nBecause if it’s not meaningful, it’s not done.\nThis is how we build. This is who we are.\n\nP.S. - Here’s a picture of Himanshu infront our Lakshya war room just before a meeting.\n\n#office #hustle #culture #apna","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_office-hustle-culture-activity-7441818814918602752-Waw3"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"apna","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/apnahq"},"datePublished":"2026-03-23T07:08:52.659Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_recruitment-hiring-hr-activity-7441742750762479616-lOOr","text":"Great recruiters often stand out for one key strength.\n\nBut everyone has a different view on what matters most.\nLet’s be honest about what makes a great recruiter.\n\nVote below 👇\n\n#Recruitment #Hiring #HR #TalentAcquisition #jobs ","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_recruitment-hiring-hr-activity-7441742750762479616-lOOr"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"apna","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/apnahq"},"datePublished":"2026-03-20T09:29:31.167Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_hiring-recruitment-hiringpartners-activity-7440690980833456128-wcWn","text":"Great teams start with the right people.\n\nWe are glad to partner with Allied Resource Management Services (I) Pvt. Ltd. as they continue to support businesses with workforce solutions across industries.\n\nIf you’re looking to build faster and find the right talent without the usual friction, we’re here to help.\n\nBuild your team on Apna: https://lnkd.in/gHZZ-s_J\n\n#Hiring #Recruitment #HiringPartners #TalentAcquisition \n\n\nNirmit Parikh | Karna Chokshi | Kartik Narayan | Mayuresh Shinde (MS) | Abhijeet Anand | Vipin Kalra | Saksham Gandhi | Thomas Lagashu | Naveen Bokka | Himanshu Pandey | Sonu A.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_hiring-recruitment-hiringpartners-activity-7440690980833456128-wcWn"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"apna","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/apnahq"},"datePublished":"2026-03-20T06:58:48.308Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_hiring-recruitment-hiringtrends-activity-7440653052358922240-TyHt","text":"Hiring speed often matters more than hiring perfectly.\nBut what actually helps teams move faster?\n\nWhat do you think improves hiring speed the most?\n\nVote below 👇\n\n\n#Hiring #Recruitment #HiringTrends #TalentAcquisition","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_hiring-recruitment-hiringtrends-activity-7440653052358922240-TyHt"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"apna","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/apnahq"},"datePublished":"2026-03-18T08:07:42.406Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_recruitment-hiring-hr-activity-7439945616262258688-KSm5","text":"Hiring in 2026 feels very different than it did a few years ago.\nBut only recruiters see what’s actually changed.\n\nWhat’s making hiring harder today?\n\nVote below 👇\n\n#Recruitment #Hiring #HR #TalentAcquisition","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_recruitment-hiring-hr-activity-7439945616262258688-KSm5"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"apna","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/apnahq"},"datePublished":"2026-03-17T08:13:12.798Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_recruitment-hiring-hr-activity-7439584614186336256-bGlY","text":"Recruiting looks simple from the outside.\nBut recruiters know the real frustrations.\n\nLet’s be honest about what really makes hiring tough.\n\nVote below 👇\n\n#Recruitment #Hiring #HR #TalentAcquisition","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/apnahq_recruitment-hiring-hr-activity-7439584614186336256-bGlY"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"apna","url":"https://in.linkedin.com/company/apnahq","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Hosur Road","addressLocality":"Bengaluru","addressRegion":"Karnataka","postalCode":"560095","addressCountry":"IN"},"description":"Founded in 2019, Apna Group is redefining the future of work for India and beyond - empowering millions of professionals and enterprises through AI-led innovation.\n\nThrough Apna.co, India’s largest early-career job marketplace, we’ve connected 6 Cr+ job seekers with 7 Lakh+ employers across 900+ cities, enabling faster, smarter, and more meaningful hiring at scale.\n\nTrusted by India’s leading enterprises such as Teleperformance, Zomato, HDB Financial Services, Bluestar, TVS, Kotak, Axis Bank, Flipkart, and Lifestyle, Apna powers workforce transformation across Retail, BFSI, Staffing, Healthcare, Manufacturing, and IT sectors.\n\nBuilding on this foundation, Apna has expanded into enterprise AI innovation with Blue Machines, our Voice AI platform that enables organizations to deploy production-grade voice agents with sub-300 ms latency and \u003C1-week deployment cycles. In its first 45 days, Blue Machines secured $6 M+ in enterprise contracts across lending, insurance, recruitment, and healthcare - making it one of India’s fastest-adopted deep-tech platforms.\nExplore more at bluemachines.ai\n\nRecognized among India’s Most Preferred Workplaces 2025–26, and as a Most Preferred Workplace for Women, Apna Group continues to build technology that empowers people, strengthens enterprises, and drives inclusive growth.\nBacked by world-class investors including Tiger Global, Sequoia Capital, Lightspeed, Insight Partners, GSV Ventures, and Owl Ventures, Apna collaborates with leading government and public institutions such as the NSDC, Ministry of Defence, UNICEF YuWaah, and AICTE to drive nationwide skilling and employability programs - powering AICTE’s career portal for over 3 million students across 22,000 colleges.\n\nVisit: apna.co\nFor employer solutions, visit: employer.apna.co\n","numberOfEmployees":{"value":1635,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQH-dUQnQRmQKQ/company-logo_200_200/B56ZpT8720JsAM-/0/1762345074559/apnahq_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=0KCoiQnA1ivoQX54PS4KBr5j3h7qzGd8sLsiFtLbIWg","description":"apna","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"India's largest early talent hiring & jobs platform","sameAs":"https://apna-job-web.app.link/e/rDYumuLGBMb"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
