  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Big teams need strong people to grow.

We’ve partnered with <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/company/bajaj-general-insurance?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bajaj General Insurance</a> (Bajaj Life Insurance Company), and they are now hiring on Apna for Agency Development Managers, Sales Managers, Business Development Managers and Team Leaders across locations.

As they expand their reach, the focus is on finding the right people faster and building teams that can deliver consistently. We’re glad to support this journey by making hiring simpler and more efficient.

Build your team on Apna: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gHZZ-s_J?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gHZZ-s_J</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhiring&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Hiring</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frecruitment&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Recruitment</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhiringpartners&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#HiringPartners</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftalentacquisition&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TalentAcquisition</a> 

<a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/in/nirmitparikh?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Nirmit Parikh</a> | <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/karnachokshi?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Karna Chokshi</a> | <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/in/kartik?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Kartik Narayan</a> | <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/in/mayuresh-shinde-ms-66293a7?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Mayuresh Shinde (MS)</a> | <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/in/abhijeet-anand571?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Abhijeet Anand</a> | <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/in/vipin-kalra-85945024?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Vipin Kalra</a> | Saksham Gandhi | <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/in/thomas-lagashu-7612511b6?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Thomas Lagashu</a> | <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/in/naveenkbokka?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Naveen Bokka</a> | <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/